i    | tell application "Foo"                                   |   	fake	(NULL)	0
i    | beep                                                     |   	fake	(NULL)	0
i    | end tell                                                 |   	fake	(NULL)	0
i    +----------------------------------------------------------+   	fake	(NULL)	0
